<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="title">找回密码</view><view class="hint">使用已验证绑定的QQ邮箱；手机号短信找回待开放。已有账号请先登录，在“我的”页验证绑定。</view><text class="label">用户名</text><input value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="input" maxlength="32"/><text class="label">已绑定QQ邮箱</text><input value="{{email}}" data-field="email" bindinput="input" maxlength="128"/><text class="label">邮箱验证码</text><input value="{{emailCode}}" data-field="emailCode" bindinput="input" type="number" maxlength="6"/><button bindtap="sendCode" loading="{{codeBusy}}" disabled="{{codeBusy || busy || cooldown > 0}}">{{cooldown ? cooldown+'秒后重试':'发送邮箱验证码'}}</button><text class="label">新密码</text><input value="{{newPassword}}" data-field="newPassword" bindinput="input" password maxlength="64"/><text class="label">确认新密码</text><input value="{{confirmPassword}}" data-field="confirmPassword" bindinput="input" password maxlength="64"/><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">重置密码</button></view></view>